{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 \outlinelevel0 \b \fs36 Juno ReaPack Scripts\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 How to install:\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab go to Extensions \u8594 ? ReaPack \u8594 ? Import repositories...\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab paste {\f1 https://github.com/juno14k/reaper-scripts/raw/master/index.xml}\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab install the scripts from {\f1 Browse packages} (search {\f1 juno}).\sa180\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 Disclaimer: all the scripts are vibe-coded.\par}
}
